## The runtime

The runtime this game is built on is part of the project, in `src/host.ts`. It
owns the frame loop and the delta time the game is given, input actions, audio
cues, asset loading, the canvas fit, and the debug overlay. `src/host.ts`
documents every API the game receives and is the authority on all of it. Read it
before you start. This specification states only what is specific to Carom.
